From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:50:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Generate a unique slug for each event

The slug comes from the title (StringUtils::slugify, numeric suffix until unique), is set in Event::save() on creation and never from the form. Authenticated users open an event at /events/{slug}.
